WEBVTT

00:02.010 --> 00:03.070
This...

00:03.070 --> 00:05.480
is a map of the mansion and its key.

00:05.760 --> 00:07.440
Thank you!

00:07.660 --> 00:11.280
His Majesty was meeting with someone, 
but when he heard you were coming...

00:11.280 --> 00:13.040
We're playing Reversi!

00:13.040 --> 00:15.270
Wait, Your Majesty!

00:15.270 --> 00:18.080
It was quite difficult to talk him out of it.

00:19.420 --> 00:21.300
<i>Sounds like I'll be able 
to go home early today.</i>

00:21.300 --> 00:23.750
Hello! Is Cain here?

00:24.130 --> 00:26.170
Oh, good. I got here in time.

00:26.810 --> 00:28.250
Duke Eric?

00:28.250 --> 00:30.840
I wanted a chance to challenge you.

00:31.190 --> 00:32.170
Would you mind?

00:32.170 --> 00:34.510
Sure... I'll play.

00:34.510 --> 00:36.070
Yes!

00:36.070 --> 00:38.270
I'm next, then!

00:38.270 --> 00:39.600
And me next!

00:39.600 --> 00:40.490
Me, too!

00:40.490 --> 00:41.560
Me, too!

00:44.170 --> 00:47.880
<i>They say the strong will always be targets,</i>

00:48.530 --> 00:51.890
<i>and I'm a reincarnated noble 
who's a little too strong.</i>

00:52.970 --> 00:58.030
<i>But that's a secret to everyone!</i>

01:08.210 --> 01:11.090
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

02:29.020 --> 02:33.310
"Welcome to My Off-the-Charts Mansion"

02:29.020 --> 02:33.310
"Welcome to My Off-the-Charts Mansion"

02:30.090 --> 02:34.550
Let's see... 
It should be around here...

02:37.980 --> 02:40.730
Whoa, it's pretty run-down.

02:42.080 --> 02:44.170
Don't let anything pop out at me...

02:46.770 --> 02:48.930
I'm coming in...

02:51.130 --> 02:52.480
The lights are out.

02:52.730 --> 02:55.190
I guess the magic stones 
are out of magic, too.

02:55.190 --> 02:56.900
Light Ball!

02:58.860 --> 03:00.700
Coming in...

03:00.940 --> 03:04.270
Oh, boy. There's nothing in the living room.

03:04.270 --> 03:06.240
I mean, the simplicity is nice, but...

03:06.850 --> 03:10.960
How many people do they want me 
to cook for?! This isn't a hotel!

03:11.290 --> 03:14.920
Is this room for parties? 
Such is the nobility...

03:15.390 --> 03:18.380
Ugh, but it's so filthy.

03:18.950 --> 03:21.340
I guess I should do a little cleaning.

03:21.340 --> 03:24.300
All Clean! All Repair!

03:28.660 --> 03:31.850
Looking good! Let's keep this going!

03:32.180 --> 03:32.770
There!

03:37.750 --> 03:39.300
<i>This is my house.</i>

03:39.300 --> 03:42.420
<i>Even without Mom, Dad, or Grandpa here...</i>

03:42.420 --> 03:43.930
Master Cain!

03:43.930 --> 03:46.830
<i>It's my house, and everyone's here.</i>

03:48.170 --> 03:49.120
Sylvia!

03:49.880 --> 03:51.330
I appreciate you coming here.

03:51.330 --> 03:54.580
Of course! When you asked me to come,

03:54.580 --> 03:57.010
I was so happy, I found myself crying!

03:57.010 --> 04:01.800
From now on, I'll work my hardest with 
the maids here in your exclusive service!

04:02.110 --> 04:03.330
Thanks.

04:03.330 --> 04:04.430
Master Cain.

04:04.810 --> 04:08.680
I am your new butler. My name is Colan.

04:08.680 --> 04:11.550
Oh, yeah. Sebas has told me about you.

04:11.550 --> 04:15.100
Sebas has told me a great 
deal about you, as well.

04:15.100 --> 04:17.680
Such as how you annihilated 
an orc army alone,

04:17.680 --> 04:19.950
how you blew away an 
entire forest with magic,

04:19.950 --> 04:22.440
and how you turn all who look 
sideways at you into stone.

04:22.730 --> 04:24.780
Uh, I never did that!

04:25.000 --> 04:28.190
All right, we'll get started 
cleaning right away.

04:28.190 --> 04:29.580
You two, over there!

04:29.580 --> 04:30.190
Right.

04:30.190 --> 04:31.380
You, over there!

04:31.380 --> 04:32.210
Right.

04:34.370 --> 04:35.530
Um...

04:35.530 --> 04:37.350
Um, Sylvia...

04:37.350 --> 04:39.420
There's not a speck of dust anywhere.

04:39.420 --> 04:43.130
Oh... Sorry. I cleaned it all up with magic.

04:43.470 --> 04:44.830
I thought so!

04:44.830 --> 04:50.100
<i>Huh?! She just accepts everything 
Master Cain does without question?!</i>

04:50.100 --> 04:51.560
In that case, Master Cain...

04:51.880 --> 04:55.650
We'll prepare to receive all of your things!

04:55.650 --> 04:57.400
I appreciate it, Sylvia.

04:57.610 --> 04:58.690
Of course!

04:58.690 --> 05:00.150
Master Cain.

05:00.390 --> 05:02.280
We will take care of things here.

05:02.280 --> 05:04.860
You should return to Lord Garm's mansion now.

05:05.090 --> 05:05.820
Today is—

05:05.820 --> 05:11.310
Oh, I forgot! Today's the day 
my older brothers come home!

05:13.690 --> 05:18.080
I never thought you'd be granted a 
peerage and receive a mansion before us.

05:18.080 --> 05:21.140
Cain really is a little 
brother we can be proud of.

05:21.140 --> 05:24.210
I can't wait to see Cain's mansion!

05:24.470 --> 05:28.110
Reine, I hear it's quite a 
run-down mansion. Are you sure?

05:28.110 --> 05:30.510
Scary things might show up.

05:30.800 --> 05:35.120
I-I'll be fine! Cain will protect me!

05:35.440 --> 05:36.280
Right?!

05:36.880 --> 05:40.360
Sister Reine, I don't think anything 
scary is going to show up.

05:40.650 --> 05:44.070
But they're saying it's really run-down!

05:47.850 --> 05:50.570
It's not run-down at all! It's sparkling!

05:50.570 --> 05:53.080
It looks like a brand-new house!

05:53.890 --> 05:55.130
What's this about?

05:55.130 --> 05:58.790
It was dilapidated and falling apart 
when I came here a few years ago.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.500
Cain, it was you, wasn't it?

06:01.500 --> 06:04.710
I just did a little remodeling 
and cleaning with magic.

06:05.600 --> 06:07.860
That's my son for you.

06:10.190 --> 06:12.100
It's beautiful inside, too!

06:12.100 --> 06:13.560
Wow!

06:13.560 --> 06:15.300
Wow!

06:16.890 --> 06:19.480
There are no works of art, though.

06:19.480 --> 06:21.810
Does it need those?

06:21.810 --> 06:24.660
Yes. Nobles are fond of artworks

06:24.660 --> 06:26.900
and decorate their mansions with
 them as a matter of course.

06:26.900 --> 06:31.450
Paintings, vases, armor... in some 
cases, even mounted monsters.

06:31.810 --> 06:35.040
Mounted monsters would work? In that case...

06:36.410 --> 06:37.700
I put one up!

06:39.130 --> 06:40.580
What is it? An enemy attack?

06:40.580 --> 06:42.130
I'll check first!

06:45.510 --> 06:46.710
Is everything all right?!

06:48.630 --> 06:51.040
D-Dragon!

06:51.040 --> 06:53.640
Oh, man! I forgot to explain it to them!

06:53.640 --> 06:56.100
Cain! What <i>is</i> this?!

06:56.500 --> 06:58.930
It's a mounted red dragon.

06:58.930 --> 07:03.310
I can see that! I'm asking you 
why you have such a thing here!

07:03.310 --> 07:06.240
Because... I defeated it.

07:06.240 --> 07:08.990
You defeated it?! When?! Where?!

07:09.740 --> 07:13.220
A while ago... when I went into that forest.

07:13.980 --> 07:16.580
A red dragon is a calamity-class monster!

07:16.900 --> 07:19.210
Even a party of A-rank adventurers 
can barely take it down,

07:19.210 --> 07:21.210
and not without losing a few!

07:21.210 --> 07:22.170
And you...

07:22.450 --> 07:24.660
R-Really?

07:24.660 --> 07:28.510
Explain it to the maids before 
something like this happens again.

07:28.730 --> 07:31.100
I-I will explain it to them.

07:32.280 --> 07:36.930
That said, a mounted red dragon is 
worth a thousand platinum coins.

07:37.190 --> 07:40.640
Maybe it's better to have this 
than some random decoration.

07:40.860 --> 07:43.400
A thousand platinum coins is...

07:43.400 --> 07:44.810
Ten billion yen?!

07:46.340 --> 07:47.810
What now?!

07:50.720 --> 07:51.860
Mother!

07:51.860 --> 07:54.160
C-Cain! What is this toilet?!

07:54.470 --> 07:56.740
It shoots water at you!

07:58.510 --> 07:59.700
What <i>is</i> it?!

07:59.960 --> 08:02.790
I used magic to make it shoot water out.

08:03.080 --> 08:04.250
Amazing!

08:04.250 --> 08:05.500
Do that to ours, too!

08:05.790 --> 08:09.370
Really, now. You two are being 
so dramatic over a mere toilet.

08:09.370 --> 08:11.470
Why don't you try it yourself, then?

08:11.770 --> 08:12.490
Hmph.

08:17.800 --> 08:19.390
What <i>is</i> that thing?!

08:19.980 --> 08:23.850
Oh, very well. If you want that, Sarah, 
I suppose we can have him do it.

08:23.850 --> 08:25.730
I guess he likes it.

08:25.730 --> 08:26.810
<i>Really</i> likes it.

08:26.810 --> 08:29.730
Cain, visitors you invite here will 
be pleased with this, as well.

08:29.730 --> 08:31.240
Visitors I invite?

08:31.240 --> 08:33.540
Yes. Nobles who come into 
ownership of a mansion

08:33.540 --> 08:36.010
must host a party to debut it. 
That's the rule.

08:36.010 --> 08:40.330
What?! Another debut party?!

08:41.540 --> 08:46.000
What am I supposed to do? 
I didn't know about this!

08:46.220 --> 08:48.810
Master Cain, I had a feeling 
it would come to this,

08:48.810 --> 08:52.440
so I made a list of the people you should 
invite and the things you'll need.

08:53.650 --> 08:55.450
Thank you, Colan!

08:55.450 --> 08:56.800
You are most welcome.

08:57.850 --> 09:00.920
Duke Eric, Prime Minister Magna...

09:01.560 --> 09:03.520
And Marquis Corgino...

09:03.910 --> 09:05.190
Do I <i>have</i> to invite him?

09:05.540 --> 09:10.150
Yes. It is common sense, I fear, 
that high-ranking nobles should be invited.

09:10.150 --> 09:12.920
He and I don't get along so well, though...

09:12.920 --> 09:16.410
Oh, I don't need to invite the king?

09:16.410 --> 09:20.190
Only those ranked as a count or higher 
can invite royalty to their mansions.

09:20.980 --> 09:23.770
Even just sending an invitation 
would be a breach of etiquette?

09:24.440 --> 09:27.170
And let's see... The things I'll need...

09:27.170 --> 09:30.290
Alcoholic drinks, food, and gifts.

09:31.850 --> 09:36.090
What would a noble even 
want to get as a gift?!

09:36.500 --> 09:39.270
Master Cain, instead of 
adhering to formalities,

09:39.270 --> 09:43.270
why don't you give them your 
own brand of hospitality?

09:43.710 --> 09:46.310
My own brand of hospitality?

09:46.310 --> 09:50.420
Yes, your own unique brand of hospitality.

09:59.530 --> 10:00.630
All right!

10:00.630 --> 10:03.760
Hospitality! Hospitality!

10:05.740 --> 10:06.940
How lovely!

10:06.940 --> 10:09.800
It sparkles like a star!

10:09.800 --> 10:14.730
Everyone here uses porcelain tableware, 
so I thought they might like these as gifts.

10:14.730 --> 10:16.470
I know they'll love it!

10:16.770 --> 10:19.490
Okay, then, I'll make enough for everyone.

10:19.490 --> 10:21.430
I'll show my hospitality with glasses!

10:21.430 --> 10:23.780
There... there... and there!

10:23.780 --> 10:27.430
Next up, the drinks and food!

10:27.640 --> 10:30.650
I followed the recipe you 
gave me, but I'm not sure...

10:30.650 --> 10:32.610
Master Cain, you called?

10:32.610 --> 10:35.690
Sylvia, I'd like you to taste 
the food I'll be serving.

10:38.720 --> 10:39.990
Delicious!

10:40.340 --> 10:41.950
It's called a Hamburg steak.

10:42.170 --> 10:44.360
Hamburg!

10:44.360 --> 10:49.210
The juices from the tender meat burst 
into my mouth the moment I take a bite!

10:49.210 --> 10:52.670
And this brown sauce is a 
perfect match! Master Cain!

10:53.380 --> 10:55.340
It's delicious!

10:55.340 --> 10:57.530
And how about this drink?

10:58.570 --> 11:03.200
It's so fizzy and bubbly, 
and it goes perfectly with the meat!

11:03.200 --> 11:04.680
What is this beverage?!

11:04.680 --> 11:06.170
Sparkling wine.

11:06.170 --> 11:08.500
I used magic to make regular wine fizzy.

11:08.500 --> 11:10.460
I can't drink alcohol yet,

11:10.460 --> 11:14.180
so you'll have to tell me honestly if the 
bubbles are too strong or anything.

11:16.660 --> 11:17.820
I don't know.

11:17.820 --> 11:18.840
Huh?

11:18.840 --> 11:21.700
I'll need another glass to be sure.

11:23.660 --> 11:25.230
She's quite the drinker...

11:25.230 --> 11:29.530
She sure is. Maybe the bubbles 
<i>are</i> too strong, in a way.

11:29.890 --> 11:32.040
Master Cain, a messenger has 
come from the royal palace.

11:32.270 --> 11:32.920
Huh?

11:36.130 --> 11:37.010
Glance.

11:37.590 --> 11:40.000
<i>It seems like the whole gang's here...</i>

11:40.000 --> 11:42.430
<i>And they don't look happy.</i>

11:44.710 --> 11:50.010
Cain, I have not received an invitation 
to your mansion's debut party.

11:50.350 --> 11:51.350
Why is this?

11:52.770 --> 11:56.530
Why?! You sent invitations to Eric and Magna!

11:56.530 --> 11:58.630
Why didn't I get one?!

11:58.630 --> 12:01.140
I'm the one who gave you that mansion!

12:02.130 --> 12:03.710
Now, now, Your Majesty.

12:03.710 --> 12:07.490
Only high-ranking nobles can 
invite you to their mansions.

12:07.490 --> 12:10.370
And more importantly, I'm your father!

12:10.370 --> 12:13.600
You would neglect your future father?!

12:13.600 --> 12:17.820
Eric was shoving his invitation 
in my face and bragging about it!

12:17.820 --> 12:20.210
Can you comprehend how vexing that is?!

12:20.210 --> 12:21.210
The truth is...

12:22.480 --> 12:26.690
I had planned to give you your invitation 
in person the next time we met.

12:26.690 --> 12:30.470
But I realize how busy you are,

12:30.470 --> 12:33.520
so I was delayed while waiting 
for the right opportunity.

12:33.830 --> 12:35.480
I sincerely apologize.

12:35.480 --> 12:37.190
I thought that must be it!

12:37.780 --> 12:40.340
See, Eric?! Didn't I tell you?!

12:40.340 --> 12:42.280
He had one for me, too!

12:42.280 --> 12:46.870
<i>I'm glad I followed Colan's advice 
and brought an invitation!</i>

12:47.480 --> 12:50.440
Cain, I will bring Telestia, as well.

12:50.440 --> 12:52.090
I look forward to the party.

12:52.090 --> 12:54.720
And I will bring Silk, as well.

12:55.130 --> 12:56.410
What?!

12:56.410 --> 12:59.130
The king will be attending?!

12:59.460 --> 13:00.920
But why?

13:00.920 --> 13:02.340
I guess I never told you.

13:02.690 --> 13:05.020
The third princess, Telestia,

13:05.020 --> 13:06.800
is actually my fiancée.

13:06.800 --> 13:10.680
What?! The princess is your fiancée?!

13:10.960 --> 13:13.130
All right, girls, calm down.

13:14.820 --> 13:19.780
No matter who attends, we maids need only 
provide the best possible hospitality.

13:19.780 --> 13:21.480
Let's welcome him with all we have.

13:21.960 --> 13:23.940
Right, Master Cain?

13:23.940 --> 13:24.840
Right.

13:25.210 --> 13:27.660
I'm counting on you all to 
make him feel welcome.

13:27.870 --> 13:30.990
Yes, Master Cain! We'll do our best!

13:33.450 --> 13:36.130
Announcing the arrival of Baron Gam.

13:36.130 --> 13:38.540
Announcing the arrival of Viscount Maki.

13:40.330 --> 13:42.050
Cain!

13:42.470 --> 13:43.760
Duke Eric.

13:44.130 --> 13:45.720
Miss Silk.

13:46.240 --> 13:48.230
Thank you for inviting us.

13:48.230 --> 13:49.800
I'll show you inside.

13:51.930 --> 13:53.770
A r-red dragon!

13:54.560 --> 13:58.300
I've heard stories about them,
 but I never thought I'd see one up close.

13:59.690 --> 14:02.230
Surprising us from the very 
first hall we enter, I see.

14:02.470 --> 14:06.010
Wow! I'll be living here one day!

14:07.460 --> 14:09.280
You're getting a bit ahead of yourself.

14:09.280 --> 14:10.270
Right...

14:10.270 --> 14:11.450
Master Cain.

14:11.820 --> 14:14.960
It is nearly time. 
Please offer your greetings.

14:15.320 --> 14:15.970
Right.

14:17.100 --> 14:21.880
Thank you all for taking the time out 
of your busy schedules to attend today.

14:22.370 --> 14:27.720
While it is a meager offering, 
I've arranged food and drinks.

14:28.070 --> 14:30.050
I hope you all enjoy them.

14:30.800 --> 14:32.510
Now, if you'll all join me...

14:33.010 --> 14:34.090
Cheers!

14:34.470 --> 14:36.180
Cheers!

14:38.250 --> 14:39.900
What is this beverage?!

14:40.230 --> 14:42.610
It's full of bubbles that pop in my mouth!

14:42.610 --> 14:44.290
I love it!

14:44.290 --> 14:46.610
And it's so ice-cold and yummy!

14:47.010 --> 14:49.630
I used water magic to chill it.

14:49.630 --> 14:51.980
And this glass!

14:51.980 --> 14:53.730
It shines so brilliantly!

14:53.730 --> 14:56.420
Just like a treasure chest!

14:56.420 --> 14:58.800
The glasses are my gifts for all attendees.

14:58.800 --> 15:00.500
Please take them home with you.

15:00.750 --> 15:03.260
Oh! I do appreciate that!

15:03.260 --> 15:04.990
The food is fantastic, as well.

15:05.350 --> 15:07.460
Look over there.

15:07.860 --> 15:11.060
Only ten years old, and you've grasped 
the ladies by their stomachs.

15:11.370 --> 15:15.300
Still a philanderer, aren't you, Cain?

15:17.480 --> 15:18.680
It's the king!

15:18.680 --> 15:20.520
The king is here!

15:21.690 --> 15:24.180
I apologize for interrupting the 
pleasant chats you were having.

15:24.180 --> 15:26.440
Pay us no mind. Continue to enjoy yourselves.

15:28.290 --> 15:29.280
What is this?

15:29.650 --> 15:33.110
Between the transparency and the pattern 
on it, I've never seen such beauty!

15:36.630 --> 15:38.760
It's so fizzy and bubbly!

15:39.110 --> 15:41.910
The bubbles are popping in my mouth!

15:41.910 --> 15:43.120
And what is this?

15:43.120 --> 15:45.090
It's a dish called Hamburg steak.

15:45.090 --> 15:47.310
Hmm. Hamburg steak, you say?

15:47.310 --> 15:50.840
It's made with meat that's been 
processed to make it tender.

15:52.730 --> 15:54.010
Hamburg!

15:54.430 --> 15:57.260
The rich juices that pour out 
from every crack in the meat!

15:57.260 --> 15:59.720
And what is this mysterious 
substance oozing out?!

15:59.720 --> 16:01.290
This is cheese?!

16:01.290 --> 16:03.850
The meat juices and the 
mellow aroma of the cheese

16:03.850 --> 16:07.860
play an exquisite harmony in my mouth!

16:09.730 --> 16:11.070
Outstanding!

16:11.070 --> 16:12.740
Teles, what do you think?

16:13.060 --> 16:15.070
Yes, it is quite delicious!

16:15.370 --> 16:17.330
Baron Cain! Baron Cain!

16:17.330 --> 16:21.770
What in the world is that in there?! 
Water spouted up from the toilet!

16:21.770 --> 16:23.310
My Queen, that is...

16:23.310 --> 16:27.170
It's revolutionary! You must put 
one in the palace right away!

16:27.170 --> 16:28.620
What's this about the toilet?

16:28.620 --> 16:30.300
Go and see for yourself!

16:30.300 --> 16:32.320
You will be most surprised!

16:40.760 --> 16:42.700
Unforgivable! Simply unforgivable!

16:42.700 --> 16:45.230
Why didn't you tell me sooner 
that you had such a fine thing?!

16:45.670 --> 16:49.220
Cain! Put one of those in the 
palace at once! Tomorrow!

16:49.220 --> 16:50.320
Please!

16:50.320 --> 16:51.820
S-Sure...

16:51.820 --> 16:52.280
Cain!

16:53.190 --> 16:57.230
Your consideration shows not only in 
the food, but in everything thereafter!

16:57.230 --> 17:00.040
I am deeply moved by your spirit!

17:00.360 --> 17:02.500
This is the ultimate hospitality!

17:02.500 --> 17:05.210
Wow! The king gave him 
the ultimate compliment!

17:05.450 --> 17:06.600
Your Majesty...

17:11.960 --> 17:13.670
<i>I'm glad I did all this.</i>

17:15.970 --> 17:19.260
Excuse me, Master Cain. May I have a moment?

17:21.220 --> 17:22.930
<i>Marquis Corgino...</i>

17:23.180 --> 17:27.240
Well, well, Baron Cain! 
Thank you for the invitation!

17:27.240 --> 17:31.400
What a small mansion it is, though. 
More like a dog house!

17:31.400 --> 17:33.040
Marquis Corgi—

17:35.330 --> 17:38.410
But we must warn him about 
the mounted monster.

17:39.620 --> 17:42.080
It's a dra-dra-dra-dragon!

17:43.060 --> 17:47.010
Please forgive me. It's a mounted red dragon.

17:47.010 --> 17:50.000
T-Tell me that sooner, you fool!

17:50.750 --> 17:54.420
Your taste is as poor as 
I expected, Baron. And...

17:54.420 --> 17:56.630
What a deplorable lineup of attendees!

17:56.630 --> 17:57.870
How vile.

17:57.870 --> 18:00.060
What an attitude for someone 
who showed up after the king.

18:00.060 --> 18:00.970
Just look at him.

18:01.260 --> 18:03.850
Ugh, it's so noisy in here.

18:04.460 --> 18:05.430
Here you are.

18:05.430 --> 18:08.390
It's the drink we used for the toast.

18:08.390 --> 18:12.480
Hmph! I'm sure a drink offered by 
the baron is of no consequence,

18:12.720 --> 18:13.770
but I'll sample it.

18:17.160 --> 18:18.560
Do you like it?

18:19.320 --> 18:20.040
No.

18:20.410 --> 18:21.870
This is Hamburg steak.

18:22.190 --> 18:25.100
Ugh, such a ridiculous-looking dish...

18:26.650 --> 18:27.700
Yum!

18:27.700 --> 18:29.170
I mean, disgusting!

18:31.130 --> 18:33.490
Yum! I mean, disgusting!

18:33.490 --> 18:36.410
Hey! Someone bring me some sauce!

18:36.920 --> 18:38.010
Give me that!

18:41.180 --> 18:43.020
This rotten...

18:43.020 --> 18:47.250
Master Cain, he is a marquis. 
You mustn't make a fuss.

18:47.250 --> 18:48.860
Just stand firm.

18:48.860 --> 18:50.310
Yeah, but...

18:51.660 --> 18:54.360
It's fine as long as
 I don't make a fuss, right?

18:55.930 --> 18:59.220
Marquis Corgino, it is a meager offering,

18:59.220 --> 19:01.790
but please take this as a token 
of my thanks for your attendance.

19:02.100 --> 19:04.830
Oh, yes, it's a meager offering, all right!

19:04.830 --> 19:06.410
But I like it!

19:06.810 --> 19:09.670
Give all of the glasses and drink to me!

19:09.670 --> 19:13.130
And have the recipe for this dish 
ready for me by the time I leave!

19:14.300 --> 19:15.840
I can't do that.

19:15.840 --> 19:18.410
What was that, you lowly baron?!

19:18.410 --> 19:23.270
I'll be giving these glasses to 
everyone in attendance today.

19:23.960 --> 19:28.270
It would look better for you to have a 
marquis using these than any of that rabble!

19:28.270 --> 19:30.640
Give me fifty! No, a hundred!

19:31.080 --> 19:32.900
I'm very sorry.

19:32.900 --> 19:36.330
I cannot grant such a request, 
even if it comes from you.

19:37.380 --> 19:40.740
Oh, but if you'd accept the 
kingdom's biggest instead...

19:41.110 --> 19:43.450
The kingdom's biggest what?! A jewel?!

19:43.450 --> 19:47.060
Oh, it's even more amazing than a jewel.

19:47.060 --> 19:50.660
What?! Even more amazing?! Give it to me!

19:51.050 --> 19:53.540
<i>Two more meters... One more meter...</i>

19:53.760 --> 19:58.130
Of course. Please accept 
this kingdom's biggest...

20:01.850 --> 20:02.980
Your Majesty!

20:02.980 --> 20:06.320
Wh-What are you doing in the home 
of such a low-ranking noble?!

20:07.770 --> 20:11.630
Well, he's the one who saved 
my daughter, Telestia.

20:11.630 --> 20:13.530
Of course I'd come.

20:13.530 --> 20:16.310
What about you, Marquis? 
When did you get here?

20:16.780 --> 20:21.030
Surely you didn't arrive later than 
the king and the rest of us, did you?

20:21.300 --> 20:24.250
N-No! Of course not!

20:24.600 --> 20:26.780
That aside, Corgino,

20:26.780 --> 20:31.080
if the tyrannical behavior I just 
witnessed is your typical attitude,

20:31.080 --> 20:33.870
then I will have to rethink 
certain future events.

20:34.220 --> 20:36.390
I-It was no such thing!

20:36.390 --> 20:41.730
I was just so impressed by the glasses and 
the meal that I asked how they were made!

20:42.320 --> 20:44.280
That is all well and good, but, Corgino...

20:45.170 --> 20:49.760
A marquis must conduct himself in a way 
that sets an example for other nobles!

20:50.280 --> 20:51.720
Understand?

20:53.610 --> 20:56.190
I-I understand!

20:58.650 --> 20:59.950
I saw that.

20:59.950 --> 21:02.150
You set that up, didn't you?

21:03.550 --> 21:06.200
You're such a little trickster, Cain.

21:07.670 --> 21:11.310
Does that mean you used us, then?

21:11.310 --> 21:16.340
Yep! I thought I might as well use the 
biggest weight in the kingdom to—

21:17.190 --> 21:19.920
Hello. I'm the biggest 
weight in this kingdom.

21:20.510 --> 21:22.840
Oh, crap! I'm in trouble again!

21:24.010 --> 21:25.760
I'm sorry!

21:25.760 --> 21:29.390
Feel <i>this</i> weight!

21:29.390 --> 21:33.530
An ordinary child would 
be crying right now...

21:33.530 --> 21:36.020
Oh, my stomach hurts!

23:08.010 --> 23:10.490
I can't believe my future son used me!

23:10.490 --> 23:14.080
I bet you intend to keep using me 
like that from now on, don't you?!

23:14.380 --> 23:15.750
No, not at all!

23:15.750 --> 23:19.300
But I couldn't defy 
Marquis Corgino to his face,

23:19.300 --> 23:22.250
so it was no more than a last resort...

23:22.570 --> 23:25.120
I knew it! You enjoyed every moment of it!

23:25.120 --> 23:27.590
I was just kidding! I'm sorry! Forgive me!

23:27.590 --> 23:28.960
Just who do you think I am, anyway?!

23:28.960 --> 23:30.700
I am the king of this nation!

23:30.700 --> 23:34.600
<i>He continued to lecture me for two hours.</i>

23:35.030 --> 23:36.510
<b>Preview</b>

23:35.490 --> 23:37.710
Next time, "A Date with the 
Strongest Captain of the Knights."

23:36.910 --> 23:40.250
<b>"A Date with the Strongest Captain of the Knights"</b>

23:37.710 --> 23:39.980
Garm, your son is a serious playboy!
